desktop.ini

# ---- 证书/私钥（首次开播时由 Sunshine 按机器生成，切勿入库）----
runtime_config/credentials/*.pem
runtime_config/client_identity/
*.pem

# C# build outputs
windows/bin/
windows/obj/
